  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As an Avatar creator, I would like to see that we can animate the IK on our avatars. For a good example, if I have a gun, I should be able to put my other hand over and lock it onto the gun with just an animation and a parent constraint, and not three arm layers and 100 things that make it take up 3MB of my avatar. Or, another good one is where I can hold a box, and both hands are locked to it and still track my hands as I hold it.\n\nI think you guys should make a component that allows us to animate our limbs but keep IK at the same time, and allow us to say how strong it should be and everything that's possible, so we can make more high-quality avatars and not have it take up so many MBs.",
